{"seq":1,"slug":"flash-attention","title":"FlashAttention IO 感知","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/io-aware/flash-attention","wordCount":1641,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"flashattention-io-感知\">FlashAttention IO 感知</h1><p>在此之前所有方法都在问「怎么少算一点」，FlashAttention 的答案却是「一次乘法都不少算，但绝不把那张 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N\\times N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 大矩阵写回显存」。它把注意力从访存受限的算子改造成算力受限的算子，靠的不是更聪明的数学，而是更懂硬件的数据编排。这是本 hub 里「改实现不改复杂度」这条正交线的主讲，也是 2022 年至今几乎每一个训练与推理栈的默认注意力实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-瓶颈不在算力-在-hbm-往返\">核心概念：瓶颈不在算力，在 HBM 往返</h2><p><a href=\"../foundations/complexity-bottleneck\">二次复杂度瓶颈</a> 里的算术强度分析给出了 FlashAttention 的全部动机。GPU 有两级存储：容量大但慢的 HBM（H100 约 3.35 TB/s），和容量极小但极快的片上 SRAM（每个 SM 只有几百 KB，带宽高一个量级）。朴素注意力的流程是：算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S=QK^\\top</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 写回 HBM → 读回 HBM 做 softmax 写回 → 再读回做 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AV</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>。那张 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N\\times N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 矩阵在慢速 HBM 里往返三趟，搬运的字节数远超真正的计算量——算子被访存拖死。</p>\n<p>FlashAttention 的核心洞察：<strong>永远不把完整的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 落地到 HBM</strong>。它把 Q、K、V 切成能塞进 SRAM 的小块，在片上把一个 query 块与所有 key 块逐块相乘、逐块累加，整个注意力在 SRAM 里一气呵成，只把最终 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N\\times d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 的输出写回 HBM。中间的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N\\times N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 矩阵从未完整存在过。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    HBM[&quot;HBM 慢速大显存&lt;br/&gt;存 Q K V O&quot;] --&gt; Load[&quot;按块载入 SRAM&quot;]&#10;    Load --&gt; Inner[&quot;SRAM 内循环&lt;br/&gt;Q 块 × 各 K 块&quot;]&#10;    Inner --&gt; Online[&quot;在线 softmax&lt;br/&gt;维护 running max 与 sum&quot;]&#10;    Online --&gt; Acc[&quot;就地累加输出块&quot;]&#10;    Acc --&gt; Write[&quot;仅写回 N×d 输出&lt;br/&gt;N×N 矩阵从不落地&quot;]&#10;    Write --&gt; HBM\">flowchart TD\n    HBM[\"HBM 慢速大显存&lt;br/&gt;存 Q K V O\"] --&gt; Load[\"按块载入 SRAM\"]\n    Load --&gt; Inner[\"SRAM 内循环&lt;br/&gt;Q 块 × 各 K 块\"]\n    Inner --&gt; Online[\"在线 softmax&lt;br/&gt;维护 running max 与 sum\"]\n    Online --&gt; Acc[\"就地累加输出块\"]\n    Acc --&gt; Write[\"仅写回 N×d 输出&lt;br/&gt;N×N 矩阵从不落地\"]\n    Write --&gt; HBM</pre><h2 id=\"在线-softmax-不看全行也能归一化\">在线 softmax：不看全行也能归一化</h2><p>分块的障碍在 softmax：它天然要看整行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个分数才能求最大值和归一化分母，而分块时你一次只有一小段分数。FlashAttention 用**在线 softmax（online softmax）**破解——边扫描边维护两个状态量：当前见过的行最大值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 和缩放后的指数和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span>。每来一个新块，就用新旧最大值的差去重新缩放已累加的结果：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>block</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub></mrow></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>block</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub></mrow></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mtext>block</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{\\text{new}}=\\max(m_{\\text{old}}, m_{\\text{block}}),\\quad \\ell_{\\text{new}}=e^{m_{\\text{old}}-m_{\\text{new}}}\\ell_{\\text{old}}+e^{m_{\\text{block}}-m_{\\text{new}}}\\ell_{\\text{block}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">block</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9713em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9713em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">block</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">block</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>输出累加器同步按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{m_{\\text{old}}-m_{\\text{new}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 缩放。扫完所有块，结果与一次性全行 softmax <strong>数值完全一致</strong>——这不是近似，是精确注意力。减去最大值这一步同时保证了指数不溢出的数值稳定性。正因为精确，FlashAttention 能无缝替换任何模型的注意力而不改变输出，这是它能席卷全行业的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-fa1-到-fa4-一部硬件适配史\">从 FA1 到 FA4：一部硬件适配史</h2><p>FlashAttention 的每一代都在追一代新 GPU 的硬件特性，理解这条演进线能帮你判断在哪张卡上该用哪一版：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>版本</th>\n<th>年份</th>\n<th>关键改进</th>\n<th>目标硬件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FA1</td>\n<td>2022</td>\n<td>分块 + 在线 softmax，显存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>A100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FA2</td>\n<td>2023</td>\n<td>更好的并行划分、减少非矩阵乘运算</td>\n<td>A100/H100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FA3</td>\n<td>2024</td>\n<td>warp 专业化、异步 TMA、FP8</td>\n<td>H100（Hopper）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FA4</td>\n<td>2026</td>\n<td>Tensor Memory、算法-kernel 协同流水</td>\n<td>B200（Blackwell）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>FlashAttention-4</strong> 于 2026 年 3 月发布论文（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2603.05451v1\">arXiv:2603.05451</a>，预览曾于 2025 年 8 月 Hot Chips 亮相）。它利用 Blackwell 每个 SM 的 256 KB 专用 Tensor Memory（TMEM），把中间结果直接留在 TMEM 而非共享内存，绕开带宽瓶颈；还改了在线 softmax——只在新行最大值「显著大于」旧值时才做重缩放，省下大量指数运算。实测在 B200、序列长 32768 上前向比 FA2 快约 <strong>3.6 倍</strong>、反向快约 <strong>3.15 倍</strong>，达到约 1605 TFLOPS、占硬件理论峰值约 <strong>71%</strong>（<a href=\"https://lambda.ai/blog/flashattention-4-gives-the-nvidia-blackwell-platform-its-most-optimized-attention-kernel-yet\">Lambda 报道</a>）。</p>\n<p>一个常被追问的细节是因果掩码与 decode。训练时的因果掩码在 FlashAttention 里不是额外开销，反而是收益——对角线以上的整块 key 全被掩掉，kernel 可以直接<strong>跳过</strong>这些块的计算，长序列下省掉近一半工作量。而 decode 阶段每步只有 1 个 query、要读全部历史 KV，此时并行度不在序列内而在 KV 上，衍生出 <strong>FlashDecoding</strong>：把长 KV 沿序列维切成多段并行归约，再用在线 softmax 合并各段的局部结果，从而喂饱 GPU 的并行单元。这正是 <a href=\"paged-attention\">分页注意力</a> 里分页感知 kernel 的计算内核，也是长上下文 decode 不至于因为「一次一个 token」而闲置算力的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么它没降复杂度却如此关键\">为什么它没降复杂度却如此关键</h2><p>必须反复强调一个容易误解的点：FlashAttention <strong>仍然做满 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 次乘法</strong>，它的渐进算力复杂度和朴素注意力一模一样。它省的是两样东西——把激活显存从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（因为不存中间矩阵），以及把 HBM 访存量降低一个量级（因为不往返搬大矩阵）。</p>\n<p>这两点合起来的效果却是革命性的：显存降到线性，意味着原本 128K 长度要 32GB 中间矩阵的场景现在能塞进单卡；访存降下来，意味着算子从访存受限回到算力受限，GPU 的算力单元终于能吃满。正因如此，FlashAttention 与所有降复杂度的方法<strong>正交且可叠加</strong>——<a href=\"../sparse-linear/sparse-attention\">稀疏注意力</a> 的块稀疏掩码可以嵌进它的分块循环跳过整块，<a href=\"../sparse-linear/linear-attention\">线性注意力</a> 的混合架构里的那几层全注意力也用它实现。它不是「另一种注意力」，而是「所有注意力的更好实现底座」。它救的主要是 prefill 的算力瓶颈与训练的显存瓶颈；反向传播的显存与多卡长序列如何处理见 <a href=\"blockwise-recompute\">分块与重计算</a>，解码阶段的分页 KV 见 <a href=\"paged-attention\">分页注意力</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>FlashAttention 一次乘法都不少算，但通过分块把注意力全程留在片上 SRAM，绝不把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N\\times N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 矩阵写回 HBM，从而把访存受限的注意力改造成算力受限。</li>\n<li>在线 softmax 用 running max 与 sum 边扫边重缩放，使分块结果与全行 softmax 数值完全一致——是精确注意力而非近似，故可无缝替换。</li>\n<li>FA1→FA4 是一部硬件适配史；FA4（2026）用 Blackwell 的 TMEM，在 B200 上前向比 FA2 快约 3.6 倍、达约 71% 硬件利用率。</li>\n<li>它不降渐进算力复杂度，但把激活显存压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、访存降一个量级，因此与所有降复杂度方法正交可叠加，是行业默认的注意力底座。</li>\n<li>它主救 prefill 与训练；反向与多卡见 <a href=\"blockwise-recompute\">分块与重计算</a>，解码见 <a href=\"paged-attention\">分页注意力</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h3><ul>\n<li>同章续读：<a href=\"blockwise-recompute\">分块与重计算</a>、<a href=\"paged-attention\">分页注意力</a></li>\n<li>动机来源：<a href=\"../foundations/complexity-bottleneck\">二次复杂度瓶颈</a>、<a href=\"../foundations/why-attention-expensive\">为何注意力昂贵</a></li>\n<li>可叠加对象：<a href=\"../sparse-linear/sparse-attention\">稀疏注意力</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：注意力复杂度的长上下文视角见 <a href=\"../../long-context-llm-techniques/foundations/attention-complexity\">62_long-context-llm-techniques / 注意力复杂度</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"FlashAttention IO 感知","id":"flashattention-io-感知"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：瓶颈不在算力，在 HBM 往返","id":"核心概念-瓶颈不在算力-在-hbm-往返"},{"level":2,"text":"在线 softmax：不看全行也能归一化","id":"在线-softmax-不看全行也能归一化"},{"level":2,"text":"从 FA1 到 FA4：一部硬件适配史","id":"从-fa1-到-fa4-一部硬件适配史"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么它没降复杂度却如此关键","id":"为什么它没降复杂度却如此关键"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"低秩与核方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/sparse-linear/low-rank-kernel"},"next":{"title":"分块与重计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/io-aware/blockwise-recompute"}}